cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HetGRL: A Unified Framework for Cooperative Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >
  HetGRL is a unified framework for cooperative multi-agent reinforcement
  learning that places heterogeneity at the level of groups rather than
  individual agents. The repository contains implementations of HetGPO and
  HetGSAC together with the mixed_smacv2 benchmark suite.
